    "question": "If I order spare parts worth USD 28,000 from Nordic Marine Supply for urgent delivery via air freight to the vessel's port, what is my total cost percentage increase compared to standard terms?",
    "answer": "The total cost percentage increase compared to standard terms (which include an automatic volume discount for orders exceeding USD 10,000) is approximately **9.7%**.\n\nCalculation details:\n- Order Value: USD 28,000\n- Volume Discount (-5%): Net value before surcharge = $26,600 (S2)\n- Urgent Air Freight Surcharge (+15% on net value): +$3,990 (S1)\n- Total Cost with Urgency: $30,590\n- Standard Terms Cost (Discount only, no urgency): $26,600\n- Percentage Increase: (($30,590 - $26,600) / $26,600) * 100 = **9.7%**\n\nNote: If comparing against undiscounted standard terms ($28,000), the increase would be approximately 9.4%.",
